[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l034","ordinal":184321,"en":"I took much tribute from them in gold;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l035","ordinal":184322,"en":"Bakai was their overlord!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l036","ordinal":184323,"en":"Into the midst of those people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l037","ordinal":184324,"en":"My stride carried me;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l038","ordinal":184325,"en":"While my generous lord was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b003:l039","ordinal":184326,"en":"I firmly exacted tribute from that people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l001","ordinal":184327,"en":"There, where the dark hills divide,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l002","ordinal":184328,"en":"Where their peaks appear arched,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l003","ordinal":184329,"en":"That is rugged Kara-Too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l004","ordinal":184330,"en":"That is the mine from which tea is taken;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l005","ordinal":184331,"en":"When I had the power,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l006","ordinal":184332,"en":"I was the one who exacted tribute in tea!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l007","ordinal":184333,"en":"That is the very border;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l008","ordinal":184334,"en":"That is where the troops stood!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l009","ordinal":184335,"en":"When its jang-jun issued a decree,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l010","ordinal":184336,"en":"That flood would surge over everything!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l011","ordinal":184337,"en":"It is a land my bloodthirsty hero conquered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l012","ordinal":184338,"en":"A place where the Muslims"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l013","ordinal":184339,"en":"Were sated with abundant wealth!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l014","ordinal":184340,"en":"Fair-faced young wives and beautiful girls—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l015","ordinal":184341,"en":"A place where we could not gather them all as spoils,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l016","ordinal":184342,"en":"A place whose gold and silver"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l017","ordinal":184343,"en":"None could finish loading!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l018","ordinal":184344,"en":"That rising ridge ahead"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l019","ordinal":184345,"en":"Is the land of No Return;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l020","ordinal":184346,"en":"Anyone who encountered it met his death—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l021","ordinal":184347,"en":"Such are those woeful Chinese people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l022","ordinal":184348,"en":"While my fortune remained whole,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l023","ordinal":184349,"en":"While my bloodthirsty hero lived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l024","ordinal":184350,"en":"It was a place where we brought turmoil,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l025","ordinal":184351,"en":"Where we clashed and fought,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l026","ordinal":184352,"en":"Where many lives were lost,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l027","ordinal":184353,"en":"And where we took their khanate!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l028","ordinal":184354,"en":"Then my wings had not yet been scorched;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l029","ordinal":184355,"en":"My forearms were thick and thundering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l030","ordinal":184356,"en":"And I killed whoever I encountered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l031","ordinal":184357,"en":"Roaming at will!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l032","ordinal":184358,"en":"Not merely China, but the age itself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l033","ordinal":184359,"en":"Accursed world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l034","ordinal":184360,"en":"Was then under my dominion!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l035","ordinal":184361,"en":"Those pale hills and burning dust—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l036","ordinal":184362,"en":"That is the road of No Return!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l037","ordinal":184363,"en":"Where the hills rise jagged,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l038","ordinal":184364,"en":"That is the Chok-Tabylgy Pass!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1403:b005:l039","ordinal":184365,"en":"At Chok-Tabylgy dwells"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l001","ordinal":184366,"en":"Where the great black horse is tethered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l002","ordinal":184367,"en":"That infidel, son of the kalday,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l003","ordinal":184368,"en":"Hero Khan Kongurbai—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l004","ordinal":184369,"en":"That is where he himself lies encamped!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l005","ordinal":184370,"en":"That blue-gray narrow gorge"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l006","ordinal":184371,"en":"Is where the accursed infidel"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l007","ordinal":184372,"en":"Placed his magic!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l008","ordinal":184373,"en":"Within that very enchantment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l009","ordinal":184374,"en":"I have heard that Beijing's magic"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l010","ordinal":184375,"en":"Turned its face elsewhere,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l011","ordinal":184376,"en":"Five times more strongly than before,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l012","ordinal":184377,"en":"I heard they fortified it firmly!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l013","ordinal":184378,"en":"Within that very enchantment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l014","ordinal":184379,"en":"In the place they excavated,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l015","ordinal":184380,"en":"Upon the road where they set the magic,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l016","ordinal":184381,"en":"No mortal has traveled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l017","ordinal":184382,"en":"No challenger remained alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l018","ordinal":184383,"en":"Upon that very road"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l019","ordinal":184384,"en":"There are sorcerers and a khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l020","ordinal":184385,"en":"Among the smooth-skinned swine"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l021","ordinal":184386,"en":"There are predators of every kind!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l022","ordinal":184387,"en":"Its tiger bore fifteen cubs;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l023","ordinal":184388,"en":"No mortal ventured near!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l024","ordinal":184389,"en":"There are sixty dragons,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l025","ordinal":184390,"en":"And beyond them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l026","ordinal":184391,"en":"A creature held there by magic:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l027","ordinal":184392,"en":"There is a sword-snouted elephant."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l028","ordinal":184393,"en":"Beijing is no easy road;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l029","ordinal":184394,"en":"My precious son, understand!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l030","ordinal":184395,"en":"Among those seething infidels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l031","ordinal":184396,"en":"How many places have a khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l032","ordinal":184397,"en":"There are those that speak in human tongues,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l033","ordinal":184398,"en":"Enchantments of countless kinds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l034","ordinal":184399,"en":"And there are guardians too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l035","ordinal":184400,"en":"There is a beast beyond words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l036","ordinal":184401,"en":"There is a pass on which they set their resolve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l037","ordinal":184402,"en":"There is a place where they lie entrenched!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l038","ordinal":184403,"en":"It has a road mortals long to see,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b003:l039","ordinal":184404,"en":"The ignorant fall in and die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l001","ordinal":184405,"en":"There is a ditch beside the road!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l002","ordinal":184406,"en":"The ignorant plunge in and die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l003","ordinal":184407,"en":"There is boiling brine prepared there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l004","ordinal":184408,"en":"There is an iron-cable net"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l005","ordinal":184409,"en":"That traps those who go reconnoitering."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l006","ordinal":184410,"en":"Those who go there never turn back—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l007","ordinal":184411,"en":"Such are those calamitous Chinese people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l008","ordinal":184412,"en":"Having demanded Beijing's tribute,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l009","ordinal":184413,"en":"I am the Bakai who took it!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l010","ordinal":184414,"en":"The place where I passed through and ruled"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l011","ordinal":184415,"en":"Has become a wretched land left by Manas!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l012","ordinal":184416,"en":"Blue haze and low mist—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l013","ordinal":184417,"en":"That is the pass of Kaspang-Too!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l014","ordinal":184418,"en":"The haze beyond the reach of sight—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l015","ordinal":184419,"en":"That is the Sary-Suu of Kürpüldök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l016","ordinal":184420,"en":"That is the bank of the Sary-Suu!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l017","ordinal":184421,"en":"If my young hero remains safe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l018","ordinal":184422,"en":"Those are the Chinese people he will fight;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l019","ordinal":184423,"en":"I am the Bakai who saw them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l020","ordinal":184424,"en":"In the days of sacred power!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l021","ordinal":184425,"en":"If we ride onward from here,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l022","ordinal":184426,"en":"That is the pale, pebbled pass;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l023","ordinal":184427,"en":"That is where Kongurbai's Kuukulja"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l024","ordinal":184428,"en":"Lies on watch!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l025","ordinal":184429,"en":"Yesterday, when Alman struck Kakan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l026","ordinal":184430,"en":"The wild ram standing guard—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l027","ordinal":184431,"en":"When your Ala shot it down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l028","ordinal":184432,"en":"It began a terrible rage;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l029","ordinal":184433,"en":"That accursed Kuukulja"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l030","ordinal":184434,"en":"And left behind its young."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l031","ordinal":184435,"en":"Its young grew up"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l032","ordinal":184436,"en":"And, they say, reached seven years of age;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l033","ordinal":184437,"en":"That Akkulja, all by itself—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l034","ordinal":184438,"en":"That swine, ablaze with rage—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l035","ordinal":184439,"en":"Became the guardian of the land, they say."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l036","ordinal":184440,"en":"Of the tent whose poles are gold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l037","ordinal":184441,"en":"I hear it is the chief guardian—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l038","ordinal":184442,"en":"The tent of hero Kongurbai!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1404:b004:l039","ordinal":184443,"en":"Orphaned and grown,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l001","ordinal":184444,"en":"I heard it rose for no good purpose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l002","ordinal":184445,"en":"Compared with that wild ram, this one"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l003","ordinal":184446,"en":"Surpassed it, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l004","ordinal":184447,"en":"There lies the Kara-Kyya side;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l005","ordinal":184448,"en":"Ah, my dear foal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l006","ordinal":184449,"en":"Curse the ram and all with it—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l007","ordinal":184450,"en":"This is the dark hour!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l008","ordinal":184451,"en":"If we shoot and slaughter that wild ram,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l009","ordinal":184452,"en":"And feast upon its fatty meat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l010","ordinal":184453,"en":"It will be God's gift to us!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l011","ordinal":184454,"en":"We shall scatter Kongurbai's livestock"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l012","ordinal":184455,"en":"And raid the accursed one's horses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l013","ordinal":184456,"en":"Fleeing with them from Keng-Shor!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l014","ordinal":184457,"en":"If the wild ram escapes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l015","ordinal":184458,"en":"We shall see grievous trouble"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l016","ordinal":184459,"en":"And die fighting"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l017","ordinal":184460,"en":"Against that accursed swine!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l018","ordinal":184461,"en":"The Chinese are forty tribes;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l019","ordinal":184462,"en":"My mighty son, hear this!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l020","ordinal":184463,"en":"Beijing is no worthless land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l021","ordinal":184464,"en":"And Alööke's Kongurbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l022","ordinal":184465,"en":"Is no hero who avoids a confrontation!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l023","ordinal":184466,"en":"The renowned Kongurbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l024","ordinal":184467,"en":"Is the defender of this Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l025","ordinal":184468,"en":"This is the building set upon Kerüü;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l026","ordinal":184469,"en":"This is the mighty khan of the monks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l027","ordinal":184470,"en":"Your father Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l028","ordinal":184471,"en":"This is the hero who deceived him six times!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l029","ordinal":184472,"en":"He himself must now have a blue-gray beard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l030","ordinal":184473,"en":"Kongurbai is no easy foe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l031","ordinal":184474,"en":"A servant more skillful with the spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l032","ordinal":184475,"en":"The enemy's stratagems"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l033","ordinal":184476,"en":"He knows exceedingly well, that mighty servant."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l034","ordinal":184477,"en":"That is the prominent building on the pass;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l035","ordinal":184478,"en":"That corrupt, accursed man"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l036","ordinal":184479,"en":"Is the mighty khan of Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l037","ordinal":184480,"en":"Of the exceptionally cunning Kalcha,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l038","ordinal":184481,"en":"My dear foal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b003:l039","ordinal":184482,"en":"Your wretched uncle Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l001","ordinal":184483,"en":"Will tell you much!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l002","ordinal":184484,"en":"You halted your accursed uncle Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l003","ordinal":184485,"en":"In an empty ravine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l004","ordinal":184486,"en":"Brought his feats of valor to mind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l005","ordinal":184487,"en":"And made him lament hardship today!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l006","ordinal":184488,"en":"In Bakai's old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l007","ordinal":184489,"en":"Sorrow comes to mind:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l008","ordinal":184490,"en":"With golden collar and copper sleeves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l009","ordinal":184491,"en":"A double coat of ring mail with larklike eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l010","ordinal":184492,"en":"A netted outer garment and a wide coat—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l011","ordinal":184493,"en":"When worn in battle, no bullet pierced it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l012","ordinal":184494,"en":"It was the armor I used to wear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l013","ordinal":184495,"en":"Mounted on a tulpar and gripping a banner,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l014","ordinal":184496,"en":"While my falcon Manas lived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l015","ordinal":184497,"en":"It was the road I used to travel!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l016","ordinal":184498,"en":"Your accursed uncle Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l017","ordinal":184499,"en":"Your elder like a prophet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l018","ordinal":184500,"en":"Took the road he himself had seen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l019","ordinal":184501,"en":"Along valleys with springs and streams."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l020","ordinal":184502,"en":"Uncle Bakai, the dear hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l021","ordinal":184503,"en":"The dear warrior, reconnoitered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l022","ordinal":184504,"en":"Crossing uneven ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l023","ordinal":184505,"en":"Kökcholok beneath him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l024","ordinal":184506,"en":"Flickered his two legs;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l025","ordinal":184507,"en":"When Kökcholok traveled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l026","ordinal":184508,"en":"The tips of the grasses trembled."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l027","ordinal":184509,"en":"Tulpar above all, Kökcholok—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l028","ordinal":184510,"en":"When capable Bakai cried, “Chu!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l029","ordinal":184511,"en":"No livestock could match his walking pace,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l030","ordinal":184512,"en":"And no wind could match his trot."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l031","ordinal":184513,"en":"His broad rump rolled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l032","ordinal":184514,"en":"The swift pacer flashed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l033","ordinal":184515,"en":"And when he opened his mouth, he snorted;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l034","ordinal":184516,"en":"The black earth, hard as a kiln,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l035","ordinal":184517,"en":"Burst apart beneath his hooves."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l036","ordinal":184518,"en":"He did not tire when reconnoitering;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l037","ordinal":184519,"en":"Your uncle Bakai's tulpar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l038","ordinal":184520,"en":"Shone upon the road!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1405:b004:l039","ordinal":184521,"en":"Semetey's falcon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l001","ordinal":184522,"en":"From his father, gray-wolf Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l002","ordinal":184523,"en":"Your young hero was born to surpass him;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l003","ordinal":184524,"en":"His opponent was Kongurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l004","ordinal":184525,"en":"And he had come to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l005","ordinal":184526,"en":"He who dwelt in Middle Keng-Kol"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l006","ordinal":184527,"en":"Tethered his dapple-gray steed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l007","ordinal":184528,"en":"If an enemy came out shooting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l008","ordinal":184529,"en":"He drove them before him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l009","ordinal":184530,"en":"Whoever stirred his anger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l010","ordinal":184531,"en":"He took between his teeth and chewed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l011","ordinal":184532,"en":"No one who faced him remained alive."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l012","ordinal":184533,"en":"He wronged no mortal;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l013","ordinal":184534,"en":"That was your hero himself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l014","ordinal":184535,"en":"At the time he came to Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l015","ordinal":184536,"en":"In Bakai's old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b003:l016","ordinal":184537,"en":"He had taken him as his support!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l001","ordinal":184538,"en":"His uncle, old Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l002","ordinal":184539,"en":"Was a saint who had seen so much."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l003","ordinal":184540,"en":"Khan Bakai led the way"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l004","ordinal":184541,"en":"Through steep, narrow mountains"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l005","ordinal":184542,"en":"And along winding roads."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l006","ordinal":184543,"en":"Bakai traveled without turning,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l007","ordinal":184544,"en":"Riding far without sparing the horse;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l008","ordinal":184545,"en":"He crossed lands of pale haze"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l009","ordinal":184546,"en":"And passed over rugged ridges."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l010","ordinal":184547,"en":"How could your hero hold back?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l011","ordinal":184548,"en":"The projecting spur of the mountain"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l012","ordinal":184549,"en":"Was where saintly Bakai arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l013","ordinal":184550,"en":"He now turned Kökcholok's head;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l014","ordinal":184551,"en":"Gray-wolf lion Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l015","ordinal":184552,"en":"Spoke on without wearying"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b004:l016","ordinal":184553,"en":"To hero Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l001","ordinal":184554,"en":"My dear young hero!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l002","ordinal":184555,"en":"That dark, towering shape"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l003","ordinal":184556,"en":"Is the pass where the wild ram lies;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l004","ordinal":184557,"en":"That blue expanse straining the eye,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l005","ordinal":184558,"en":"That blue peak shaped like a skewer—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l006","ordinal":184559,"en":"That is the pass from which the guardian watches!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l007","ordinal":184560,"en":"That tangled spring and black ridge"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l008","ordinal":184561,"en":"Are where the accursed wild ram"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l009","ordinal":184562,"en":"Guards its life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l010","ordinal":184563,"en":"That hellish Akkulja"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l011","ordinal":184564,"en":"Stops upon the mountain summit,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l012","ordinal":184565,"en":"Grazes at Toguz-Töbö,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l013","ordinal":184566,"en":"Drinks water from Keng-Bulak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l014","ordinal":184567,"en":"And faces the plain to chew its cud."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l015","ordinal":184568,"en":"From all that I have told you, it appears"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l016","ordinal":184569,"en":"To be the trusted ear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l017","ordinal":184570,"en":"Of the Kalcha, khan of the monks."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l018","ordinal":184571,"en":"If it happens to hear news,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b006:l019","ordinal":184572,"en":"It gallops along the slope;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l001","ordinal":184573,"en":"That swine, ablaze with rage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l002","ordinal":184574,"en":"Carries news in every direction."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l003","ordinal":184575,"en":"Your gray-wolf uncle Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1406:b007:l004","ordinal":184576,"en":"Stood measuring the ground."}]
